Kestrel Vault is a substantial rewrite of BNDGG-Vault. Changes include:

  * A redesigned PySide6 interface with 12 themes and 10 accent colours
  * Vault schema v3, with automatic migration from v2
    (the original vault is preserved as vault.v2.bak)
  * Argon2id key derivation (t=3, m=64 MiB, p=4)
  * Full otpauth:// TOTP support with a live refresh bar
  * A password health report (weak / reused / old passwords)
  * CSV importers for Bitwarden, 1Password and browser exports
  * Encrypted backup export/restore with pre-import snapshots
  * Configurable auto-lock (idle, on minimize, on blur)
  * Sensitive clipboard handling with auto-clear and manager hints
  * Instant Caps Lock warning while typing a master password

See README.md for usage and CHANGES.md for the full change history.
